```
When you initialize an agent, you define tools like this:

tools = [
    {
        "type": "function",
        "function": {
            "name": "get_weather",
            "description": "Get current weather for a location. 
                           Use this when user asks about weather, 
                           temperature, or climate conditions.",
            "parameters": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                    "city": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "City name, e.g. 'Tokyo', 'New York'"
                    },
                    "unit": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "enum": ["celsius", "fahrenheit"],
                        "description": "Temperature unit"
                    }
                },
                "required": ["city"]
            }
        }
    }
]

This schema gets sent to the LLM with EVERY request.
The LLM reads this and learns:
  "I have a tool called get_weather"
  "It takes a required 'city' parameter"
  "It optionally takes a 'unit' parameter"
```
